:::slide{type=session}
# How the weeks go

- **Weeks 1–2 · Arrive** — settle in, notice the noise, learn to breathe on purpose.
- **Weeks 3–4 · Steady** — build a short daily practice around your real days.
- **Weeks 5–6 · Root** — make it yours, so it holds when the week gets loud.
:::

